<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Phase 22 · Chevy Miasma Decker 9000 · Miasma Temple Boiler Mark 1</title>
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{
  --void:#000008;
  --forge:#06060e;
  --deep:#0a0a14;
  --steam:#39ff14;
  --hydro:#00e5ff;
  --elec:#ffd700;
  --mech:#ff8c00;
  --brake:#ff6ec7;
  --ctrl:#b388ff;
  --therm:#ff6b35;
  --water:#40e0d0;
  --struct:#c0c8d0;
  --safe:#ff4500;
  --text:#e8eef4;
  --muted:#6080a0;
  --worm:#c9a84c;
  --new:#00ffcc;
  --cvt:#1D9E75;
  --shaft:#D85A30;
  --drive:#BA7517;
  --temple:#cd7f32;
  --boiler:#b87333;
  --inject:#00bfff;
  --font-d:'Georgia',serif;
  --font-b:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;
  --font-m:'Courier New',monospace;
}
body{font-family:var(--font-b);background:var(--void);color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;overflow-x:hidden}

.banner{position:relative;background:var(--void);border-bottom:2px solid #0d0d20;padding:5rem 2rem 4rem;text-align:center;overflow:hidden;}
.banner::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 50% at 20% -10%,#cd7f3208,transparent),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 80% -10%,#00ffcc05,transparent),
    repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,transparent 80px,#ffffff01 81px),
    repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent,transparent 80px,#ffffff01 81px);}
.phase-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--temple);border:1px solid #cd7f3240;padding:8px 28px;border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:2rem;position:relative;}
.phase-pill::before{content:'';width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--temple);box-shadow:0 0 20px var(--temple);animation:blink 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;}
@@keyframes blink{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.05}}
.banner h1{font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);font-weight:400;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:1.5rem;}
.banner h1 .s{color:var(--steam)}.banner h1 .w{color:var(--new)}.banner h1 .e{color:var(--elec)}.banner h1 .t{color:var(--temple)}
.banner p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.95}
.banner strong{color:var(--temple)}
.delta-box{display:inline-block;margin-top:1.5rem;background:var(--forge);border:1px solid #cd7f3230;border-left:3px solid var(--temple);padding:.8rem 1.4rem;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--temple);text-align:left;max-width:900px;width:100%;}
.delta-box span{color:var(--muted);display:block;line-height:1.8}

.tab-nav-wrap{background:var(--forge);border-bottom:2px solid #0d0d20;position:relative;}
.tab-nav{display:flex;gap:0;overflow-x:auto;scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#1a1a30 var(--forge);}
.tab-nav::-webkit-scrollbar{height:4px}.tab-nav::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:var(--forge)}.tab-nav::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#1a1a30;border-radius:2px}
.scroll-btn{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:36px;border:none;background:none;cursor:pointer;z-index:10;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;transition:color .2s;}
.scroll-btn:hover{color:var(--text)}.scroll-btn.left{left:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--forge) 60%,transparent)}.scroll-btn.right{right:0;background:linear-gradient(270deg,var(--forge) 60%,transparent)}
.tab{flex:0 0 auto;min-width:175px;padding:1.1rem .9rem;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;border-right:1px solid #0d0d20;transition:all .25s;color:var(--muted);border-bottom:3px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap;}
.tab:hover{background:#0a0a18;color:var(--text)}
.tab.active{background:#040408;}
.tab.t-engine{color:var(--shaft);border-bottom-color:var(--shaft)}
.tab.t-temple{color:var(--temple);border-bottom-color:var(--temple)}
.tab.t-water{color:var(--water);border-bottom-color:var(--water)}
.tab.t-ewi{color:var(--inject);border-bottom-color:var(--inject)}
.tab.t-elec{color:var(--elec);border-bottom-color:var(--elec)}
.tab.t-side{color:var(--mech);border-bottom-color:var(--mech)}
.tab.t-top{color:var(--ctrl);border-bottom-color:var(--ctrl)}
.tab.t-road{color:var(--water);border-bottom-color:var(--water)}
.tab.t-temp{color:var(--therm);border-bottom-color:var(--therm)}
.tab.t-stress{color:var(--safe);border-bottom-color:var(--safe)}
.tab.t-safety{color:var(--brake);border-bottom-color:var(--brake)}
.tab.t-parts{color:var(--struct);border-bottom-color:var(--struct)}

.panel{display:none;animation:fadein .35s ease}.panel.active{display:block}
@@keyframes fadein{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

.wrap{max-width:1500px;margin:0 auto;padding:3.5rem 2rem}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.5rem}
.section-title{font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:400;color:#fff;margin-bottom:.7rem;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.section-lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.95;max-width:1100px;margin-bottom:2rem}
.sep{border:none;border-top:1px solid #0d0d20;margin:3.5rem 0}

.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(130px,1fr));gap:1px;background:#0d0d20;border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;margin:2rem 0}
.metric{background:var(--forge);padding:1.4rem .8rem;text-align:center}
.metric .val{font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:1.9rem;line-height:1;margin-bottom:.3rem}
.metric .lbl{font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em}

.schem{background:var(--void);border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-radius:3px;padding:1rem;overflow-x:auto;margin:1.5rem 0}

.g2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(360px,1fr));gap:1.4rem;margin:1.5rem 0}
.g3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.4rem;margin:1.5rem 0}
.g4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:1.2rem;margin:1.5rem 0}

.card{background:var(--forge);border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-radius:3px;padding:1.6rem}
.card h3{font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:1rem;font-weight:400;color:#fff;margin-bottom:.7rem}
.card p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:.7rem}
.srow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11.5px;padding:.35rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #0a0a18;color:var(--muted)}
.srow:last-child{border-bottom:none}.srow .v{font-weight:600}

.badge{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:.7rem;border:1px solid}
.new-badge{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid var(--temple);color:var(--temple);margin-left:.5rem}

.tbl{background:var(--void);border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-radius:3px;overflow-x:auto;margin:1.5rem 0}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;min-width:600px}
thead{background:var(--forge)}
th{font-family:var(--font-m);font-weight:400;text-align:left;padding:.8rem 1rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-size:9px;border-bottom:2px solid #0d0d20;color:var(--struct)}
td{padding:.65rem 1rem;border-bottom:1px solid #0a0a18;color:var(--text);font-size:12px}
tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
tbody tr:hover{background:var(--forge)}

.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem 1.4rem;background:var(--forge);border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-radius:3px;padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin:1rem 0;font-size:10.5px;font-family:var(--font-m)}
.leg-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}
.leg-dot{width:20px;height:3px;border-radius:2px}

.warn-box{background:var(--forge);border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-left:4px solid var(--elec);border-radius:3px;padding:1.4rem;margin:1.5rem 0}
.warn-box h4{font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--elec);margin-bottom:1rem}
.warn-box li{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.5rem;list-style:none;padding-left:1rem;position:relative}
.warn-box li::before{content:'⚠';position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--elec);font-size:10px}

.new-box{background:var(--forge);border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-left:4px solid var(--temple);border-radius:3px;padding:1.4rem;margin:1.5rem 0}
.new-box h4{font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--temple);margin-bottom:1rem}
.new-box li{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.5rem;list-style:none;padding-left:1.2rem;position:relative}
.new-box li::before{content:'▶';position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--temple);font-size:9px;top:2px}

.pass{color:var(--steam)}.fail{color:var(--safe)}.warn{color:var(--elec)}.na{color:var(--muted)}.isnew{color:var(--temple)}

@@keyframes steamflow{to{stroke-dashoffset:-24}}
@@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:.35}50%{opacity:1}}
@@keyframes powerpulse{to{stroke-dashoffset:-16}}
@@keyframes spin{from{transform:rotate(0deg)}to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
@@keyframes spincw{from{transform:rotate(360deg)}to{transform:rotate(0deg)}}
@@keyframes glow{0%,100%{opacity:.1}50%{opacity:.4}}
@@keyframes chainmove{to{stroke-dashoffset:-20}}
@@keyframes waterflow{to{stroke-dashoffset:-16}}
@@keyframes templeglow{0%,100%{opacity:.15}50%{opacity:.7}}
@@keyframes drivepulse{to{stroke-dashoffset:-24}}
@@keyframes mistpulse{0%,100%{opacity:.2}50%{opacity:.9}}
@@keyframes heatpulse{0%,100%{opacity:.3}50%{opacity:1}}

.a-steam{stroke-dasharray:8,4;animation:steamflow 1.8s linear infinite}
.a-pulse{animation:pulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite}
.a-power{stroke-dasharray:6,3;animation:powerpulse 1.4s linear infinite}
.a-spin{animation:spin 1s linear infinite}
.a-spincw{animation:spincw 1s linear infinite}
.a-glow{animation:glow 2s ease-in-out infinite}
.a-chain{stroke-dasharray:6,3;animation:chainmove 1s linear infinite}
.a-water{stroke-dasharray:5,4;animation:waterflow 1s linear infinite}
.a-temple{animation:templeglow 2s ease-in-out infinite}
.a-drive{stroke-dasharray:10,4;animation:drivepulse 1.2s linear infinite}
.a-mist{animation:mistpulse .8s ease-in-out infinite}
.a-heat{animation:heatpulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite}

.footer{background:var(--forge);border-top:1px solid #0d0d20;padding:1.5rem;text-align:center;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:10px;color:#2a1a00;letter-spacing:.1em}
@@media(max-width:700px){.wrap{padding:2rem 1rem}.tab{min-width:140px;padding:.7rem .5rem}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="banner">
  <div class="phase-pill">Phase 22 · Miasma Temple Boiler Mark 1 · Chevy Miasma Decker 9000</div>
  <h1><span class="s">Chevy</span> <span class="w">Miasma</span> <span class="e">Decker</span> <span class="t">9000</span></h1>
  <p>
    Phase 22 water and steam system redesign. <strong>Miasma Temple Boiler Mark 1 replaces previous flash boiler.</strong>
    Half-gallon stainless 304 domed-cube pressure vessel · Internal hollow copper cascade pyramid temple · Cone rivets on horizontal faces · Dome rivets on vertical and curved interior faces ·
    High-pressure atomizing mist injector replaces drip EWI · Hollow pyramid internal resistance heater coil · Dual high-position 3/4 inch steam outlets with internal standpipes.
    10 gallon polypropylene unpressurized water tank (Phase 22 reduced from 20 gal — rear placement optimized) ·
    24V diaphragm pump · Dual stage water filter (50 micron + 5 micron) · High pressure EWI accumulator pump system.
    CVT hydrostatic drivetrain · 3 locked diffs · amber driveshaft · rear 2WD all carried forward from Phase 21.
    Cold start target: 15–20 seconds. Operating PSI: 90 PSI. Pressure vessel rated to 400–500 PSI at 1cm stainless 304 walls.
  </p>
  <div class="delta-box">
    PHASE 22 CHANGES FROM PHASE 21
    <span>▶ Miasma Temple Boiler Mark 1 replaces Phase 21 1-gallon conventional flash boiler</span>
    <span>▶ Boiler vessel: half-gallon stainless 304 domed-cube — 14cm outer / 12cm inner / 1cm walls / 4 domed faces / flat top + flat bottom</span>
    <span>▶ Internal structure: hollow copper stepped cascade pyramid temple — 3 levels — water falls by gravity top to bottom</span>
    <span>▶ Pyramid heating: internal resistance heater coil wound inside hollow copper pyramid — heats from core outward simultaneously</span>
    <span>▶ Leidenfrost breaking: cone rivets on all horizontal pyramid step faces — dome rivets on vertical faces + interior domed walls</span>
    <span>▶ EWI upgraded: high-pressure atomizing mist injector replaces low-pressure drip — pressure injection breaks Leidenfrost vapor cushion on impact</span>
    <span>▶ EWI system adds: high-pressure micro pump (100–300 PSI) + 0.5L accumulator + solenoid injector + atomizing nozzle</span>
    <span>▶ Steam outlets repositioned: two 3/4 inch outlets moved to top of front face — internal standpipes guarantee dry steam only exits</span>
    <span>▶ Water tank: 10 gallon polypropylene unpressurized (Phase 21 was 20 gal SS — reduced for rear packaging, condenser loop restores range)</span>
    <span>▶ Water filtration: dual stage inline filter added (50 micron sediment + 5 micron fine) between pump and EWI</span>
    <span>▶ Distilled/deionized water preferred — tap water emergency fill acceptable — labeled on tank</span>
    <span>▶ CVT hydrostatic · 3 locked diffs · amber driveshaft · alternator chain · all mechanical systems carried forward from Phase 21</span>
    <span>▶ Cold start revised from 74 sec (Phase 21 conventional) to estimated 15–20 sec (Miasma Temple with internal coil heater)</span>
    <span>▶ Water tank reduced from Phase 21 20 gal to 10 gal — condenser loop near-infinite range still applies</span>
  </div>

</div>


<div class="tab-nav-wrap">
  <button class="scroll-btn left" onclick="scrollTabs(-200)">&#8592;</button>
  <div class="tab-nav" id="tabNav">
   
    <div class="tab t-engine active" onclick="showTab('engine',this)">⚙️ Engine<br><small style="font-size:7px">Phase 22 Overview · CVT</small></div>
